  [1;34m"body"[m[1;37m:[m [32m"## Summary\n\nAuto-generated [ECC Tools](https://ecc.tools) bundle that adds **repo-local** Claude Code and Codex scaffolds derived from git-history analysis.\n\n**Status:** 🟡 **Conditional — do not merge as-is.** Devin Review + ArchW1z disposition found generator defects and convention mismatches. Fix or regenerate, then retarget to `master-staging`.\n\n### Intent (keep)\n\nGive agents a discoverable repo skill + workflow command for CI gates, plus optional Codex multi-agent role configs and continuous-learning instincts.\n\n### What lands\n\n| Path | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `.claude/ecc-tools.json` | ECC install/upgrade/uninstall manifest |\n| `.claude/skills/termux-monorepo/SKILL.md` | Claude Code repo skill |\n| `.agents/skills/termux-monorepo/SKILL.md` | Codex-facing skill copy |\n| `.agents/skills/termux-monorepo/agents/openai.yaml` | Codex skill UI metadata |\n| `.claude/identity.json` | Suggested identity baseline |\n| `.codex/config.toml` | Repo-local Codex MCP + multi-agent baseline |\n| `.codex/AGENTS.md` | Codex guide (must **supplement** root `AGENTS.md`) |\n| `.codex/agents/{explorer,reviewer,docs-researcher}.toml` | Role configs |\n| `.claude/homunculus/instincts/inherited/termux-monorepo-instincts.yaml` | Optional continuous-learning instincts |\n| `.claude/commands/add-new-gate-to-ci-pipeline.md` | Gate workflow command scaffold |\n\n### Blockers before merge (Devin + ArchW1z)\n\n1. **🔴 Skills unloadable** — both `SKILL.md` files are wrapped in a literal ` ```markdown ` fence and lack YAML `name` / `description` frontmatter (compare `.agents/skills/find-skills/SKILL.md`).\n2. **🔴 Truncated content** — Overview ends with `... [truncated]`; regenerate full text.\n3. **🟡 Command name mismatch** — docs say `/add-gate`; shipped command is `/add-new-gate-to-ci-pipeline`.\n4. **🟡 False conventions** — skill/instincts claim kebab-case files, camelCase functions, relative-import-only; this tree is largely **snake_case** Python (`repo_gate.py`, `central_mapper_v420.py`). Prefer real layout: `scripts/ci/*.py`, `tests/test_*.py`, `docs/ARCHW1Z-GATE.md`.\n5. **🟡 Conflicting test placement** — skill says “alongside source”; instincts say `tests/` — pick one (repo: `tests/`).\n6. **🔍 Hard-coded `model = \"gpt-5.4\"`** — conflicts with multi-provider conductor (`.agents` / `.claude` / `.codex` / `.hermes` / `.pi`). Parameterize or mark as example-only.\n7. **🟨 Security defaults** — `workspace-write` + live web + `npx -y @latest` MCPs are aggressive for a repo with session-store history; prefer safer in-repo defaults and keep secrets in `~/.codex/config.toml`.\n\n### Integration notes\n\n- **Base branch:** currently `master`. Root `AGENTS.md` / proposal process live on **`master-staging`** — retarget when ready so `.codex/AGENTS.md` truly supplements root guidance.\n- **Root `AGENTS.md` inventory:** present on `master-staging` and on `agent/repository-hygiene` (PR #3, older security guidelines); **absent on `master`** today. This PR only adds `.codex/AGENTS.md`.\n- **Gates:** any follow-up that touches CI must stay aligned with `docs/ARCHW1Z-GATE.md` (`repo_gate` + `termux_smoke`).\n- **Out of scope:** replacing ArchW1z proposal process, relaxing session-store bans, wholesale MCP trust.\n\n### Review checklist\n\n- [ ] Strip code fences; add skill frontmatter on both `SKILL.md` copies\n- [ ] Regenerate without truncation; fix naming/test/command accuracy\n- [ ] Soften model pins / document multi-provider selection\n- [ ] Safer Codex sandbox defaults (or explicit Operator opt-in in this body)\n- [ ] Retarget base → `master-staging`\n- [ ] Re-run Devin / ArchW1z review after fixes\n\n### Optional after merge\n\n```text\n/instinct-import .claude/homunculus/instincts/inherited/termux-monorepo-instincts.yaml\n```\n\nOnly if you use continuous-learning-v2.\n\n---\n\n**Disposition comment:** https://github.com/timerloggedout-spec/termux-monorepo/pull/12#issuecomment-5160811285  \n**Devin Review:** https://app.devin.ai/review/timerloggedout-spec/termux-monorepo/pull/12\n\n<sub>[ECC Tools](https://ecc.tools) · [Everything Claude Code](https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code)</sub>\n"[m
